@startuml agentic-offering-service-boundary
title Agentic Offering / Agentic Service Boundary ; per ADR-ES-018 §4

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Agentic Offering" as AO
class "Agentic Product" as AP
class "Agentic Service" as AS

AO --> AP : may comprise / expose
AO --> AS : may comprise / expose

note right
  Per ADR-ES-018 §4 + AOFF-NEG-003 + AOFF-NEG-015:
  - Agentic Offering is NOT Agentic Service
  - Agentic Service does NOT automatically make the whole Offering agentic
end note

@enduml
